WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
MAIRO reads your public website pages — nothing private, nothing posted.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Each step is ticked only when its work is really done.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Then it shows what it understood, and where each fact came from.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Its own ideas are labelled as suggestions — never presented as facts about you.
